                },
                {
                  "severity": "minor",
                  "issue": "Several layout details are left open: where BillRow V2's alternative caption goes (line 2 already has content on both sides), which disclosure the OWNER group gets, and where TextActionRow's minting spinner goes (V1 has no 'link row').",
                  "evidence": "BillRow: 'a line-2 caption \"Maya can mark this paid\"'. MemberRow ⑦ lists disclosures for members, admins and guests only. TextActionRow S2: 'shows a 12pt spinner on the link row'.",
                  "fix": "State each one. BillRow: 'the caption replaces the right side of line 2'. MemberRow: 'OWNER has no disclosure'. TextActionRow: 'the 12pt spinner replaces the start of the \"Compare with a friend\" label and the label reads \"Making a link…\"'."
                },
                {
                  "severity": "minor",
